msgid ""
"<h1>Configuring GOFAI</h1>"
"<h2>Data view</h2>"
"<br><b>Maximum items:</b> shows how many items can be in the view at once. "
"Setting it to a convenient level may help to keep the visual image at a "
"manageable complexity. At the same time, you should be avare that for a low "
"value some of the immediate neighbors may fall out of the view."
"<h2>Look & Feel</h2>"
"<br><b>Base font size:</b> Shows the relative size of the fonts. The fonts will "
"be scaled anyhow with the size of the window and the distance from the center "
"<br><b>Colors:</b> Sets the colors of the different widgets and the links with "
"negative or positive weight."
"<br><b>Animation:</b> Animated navigation. Turn it of on slow machines"
msgstr ""
